# ============================================================================
#  Jawad's apartment, Deggendorf  -  simulation map for the Neato D3
# ============================================================================
#  Units: metres, angles in degrees. Everything after '#' is a comment.
#
#  Coordinate frame (seen from above):
#    origin  = back corner on the kitchen side (behind where the photos were taken)
#    x       -> along the room, towards the entrance door
#    y       -> across the room, from the kitchen wall (y = 0) to the wardrobe wall
#
#  !! ALL DIMENSIONS ARE ESTIMATED FROM PHOTOS !!
#  Measure with a tape and correct the numbers - no recompiling needed.
#  The LiDAR scans at about 9 cm above the floor, so only things that reach
#  down to that height matter (table top and hanging coats are invisible to it).
#
#  Commands:
#    room      W H                          size, used for drawing
#    material  name reflectivity mirror colour
#              reflectivity 0..1 (white paint ~0.85, black ~0.1)
#              mirror 0..1 = chance that a beam reflects like a mirror (glass)
#    wall      x1 y1 x2 y2 material
#    box       name x0 y0 x1 y1 material    axis-aligned rectangle obstacle
#    circle    name cx cy r material        round obstacle (stools, robots)
#    start     x y heading                  robot pose in front of its dock
#    waypoint  x y                          mission route, in order
# ============================================================================

room 5.20 2.45

material wall            0.85 0.00 e7e3dc
material door            0.80 0.00 f6f5f2
material oak             0.60 0.00 c39a6b
material white_gloss     0.80 0.02 f4f4f1
material black_glass     0.08 0.40 23272e
material black_metal     0.12 0.00 2b2e34
material leather_orange  0.55 0.00 e8742a
material cardboard       0.50 0.00 c8a574
material white_plastic   0.80 0.00 fbfbfa
material black_plastic   0.15 0.00 30343b

# --- Room shell --------------------------------------------------------------
wall 0.00 0.00 5.20 0.00 wall          # kitchen-side wall
wall 0.00 2.45 5.20 2.45 wall          # wardrobe-side wall
wall 0.00 0.00 0.00 2.45 wall          # back wall (not in the photos: please check!)
wall 5.20 0.00 5.20 0.85 wall          # entrance wall, right of the door
wall 5.20 0.85 5.20 1.75 door          # entrance door (closed)
wall 5.20 1.75 5.20 2.45 wall          # entrance wall, left of the door

# --- Wardrobe side (left when you face the door) -----------------------------
box wardrobe        0.00 1.83 1.25 2.45 oak
box table_pedestal  1.915 2.065 1.985 2.135 black_metal   # only the column is low enough to be seen
circle stool_1      1.55 1.90 0.19 leather_orange
circle stool_2      2.35 1.65 0.19 leather_orange
box box_large       2.45 2.00 2.95 2.40 cardboard
box box_small       2.95 2.10 3.30 2.42 cardboard

# --- Kitchen side (right when you face the door) -----------------------------
box neato_dock      0.25 0.00 0.60 0.10 black_plastic
box ecovacs_station 0.85 0.00 1.25 0.40 white_plastic
circle ecovacs_n8   1.05 0.58 0.175 white_plastic
box kitchen         1.90 0.00 4.65 0.57 white_gloss
box oven_door       3.05 0.57 3.65 0.585 black_glass     # black glass: weak and mirror-like returns

# --- Robot -------------------------------------------------------------------
start 0.42 0.30 90                      # docked, facing into the room

# One mission: leave the dock, visit the door area, come back in front of the dock.
# After the last waypoint the robot turns round and reverses onto the dock,
# like the real Neato (charging contacts are at its round back).
waypoint 0.42 1.15
waypoint 1.25 1.10
waypoint 3.00 1.05
waypoint 4.55 1.10
waypoint 4.40 1.95
waypoint 3.55 1.75
waypoint 3.00 1.05
waypoint 1.25 1.10
waypoint 0.75 1.45
waypoint 0.42 1.15
waypoint 0.42 0.62
